Keep in mind that a polypiled wand, if it does not shudder, will have
a charge status of (X+1:Y), where X is the recharge count before the
polymorph, and Y is the number of charges remaining both before and
after the polymorph.  In another game with the ability to cast
polymorph have some fun with polypiling but in this game be more
jealous of your wand charges and limit your poly stacks to higher
priority items.
